{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"上水警署男警員疑吞槍身亡\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/BODY-SS-261126-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】上水警署懷疑有警員吞槍身亡。</p><p>事發後有救護車在場。據了解，一名交通部的39歲男警員早上在上水警署的洗手間內吞槍，其後昏迷倒臥。救護員到場後，證實男警當場死亡。</p><p>警方表示，事件於早上十時多發生，懷疑與槍械有關，正調查起因。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:42:52.300570+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:03:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:36.991909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:36:20.900313+00:00","content_hash":"0d70616463cb20c87c622b79f5d5b465d0c27f533871003f9924135681ab502e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}